  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Sunshine State of Mind, a spacious and inviting beach retreat nestled in a quiet, heavily treed neighborhood with charming, winding roads in Seacrest, Florida. This beautifully designed 4-bedroom, 4.5-bath home comfortably sleeps up to 18 guests, making it an ideal choice for large families and multi-generational getaways.<br>Perfectly positioned directly across from the zero-entry community pool and a large green space, Sunshine State of Mind offers the perfect balance of relaxation and play. Kids can enjoy open space to run and play, while adults unwind poolside on the new sun loungers, tables, and chairs, ideal for sunny afternoons or peaceful evenings by the pool.<br><br>Thoughtful Living & Gathering Spaces<br>The lower level is designed for connection and comfort after a day at the beach:<br>King Suite with walk in shower, ceiling fan and TV<br>Spacious, Well equipped kitchen with island seating for 6<br>Large dining table seating 8 guests<br>Plenty of comfortable seating and a large TV for movie nights<br>Screened-in porch with ambient lighting, creating the perfect place to relax in the evening<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements<br>Bedroom 1: King bed, TV, en-suite bathroom- Lower Level<br>Bedroom 2: King bed, TV, en-suite bathroom- outdoor shower - Upper Level<br>Bedroom 3: Two Queen over Queen bunk beds with two trundles (sleeps up to 10), TV – en-suite- Upper Level<br>Bedroom 4: King bed, TV – en-suite- Upper Level<br><br>Outdoor Living & Extras<br>Two outdoor showers<br>Fire pit for evening gatherings<br>Full-size washer and dryer<br>Complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi<br>Smart TVs throughout (no cable required)<br>Four bikes included with every stay for easy exploring<br>Beach chairs and beach towels provided (large groups may wish to bring extras)<br>A selection of beach and pool toys available for guest use<br><br>Location Highlights<br>Sunshine State of Mind enjoys a prime location with easy access to all that 30A has to offer, including boutique shopping, dining, scenic bike paths, and nearby favorites such as Rosemary Beach, Alys Beach, and The Big Chill. The home is conveniently located near quaint shops and popular restaurants. Gated Beach access at Gulf Lakes is just a short walk or bike ride away.<br><br>Community Amenities – Magnolia Cottages by the Sea<br>Resort-style zero-entry pool with ample seating<br>Natural preserve setting with plenty of shade<br>Walk or bike to nearby beach towns<br>Quiet, family-friendly atmosphere<br><br>Arrival Essentials Provided<br>To help you settle in, the home includes initial supplies such as dish soap, laundry detergent, bathroom toiletries, toilet paper, and paper towels. If you have a large group or longer stays you may want to plan to bring in extra. <br><br>Explore the Area<br>Dining – Casual to Upscale<br>30A and the surrounding area offer an exceptional dining scene for every taste:<br>Casual Favorites: <br>Fish Out of Water, The Big Chill (great for families), Amavida Coffee, Shades Bar & Grill<br>Upscale & Date-Night Dining: Restaurant Paradis, Pescado Rooftop Bar, Caliza at Alys Beach, Edward's Fine Food & Wine<br><br>Beaches, Parks & Nature<br>For guests who love the outdoors, you're close to some of the area's most beautiful natural spaces:<br>Camp Helen State Park – Just minutes away, featuring beach access, coastal dune lakes, hiking trails, and kayaking<br>Grayton Beach State Park – Consistently ranked among the most beautiful beaches in the U.S.<br>Deer Lake State Park – A peaceful escape with boardwalk trails through rare coastal dunes<br><br>Shopping – Boutique & Big Brand<br>Whether you're browsing or stocking up:<br>30A boutiques and galleries in Rosemary Beach, Alys Beach, and Seaside<br>Pier Park (Panama City Beach) – A large outdoor shopping and entertainment complex with national retailers, restaurants, and live events<br><br>Boating & Water Adventures<br>Enjoy unforgettable days on the water with boat excursions available from both Panama City Beach and Destin Harbor, including:<br>Dolphin cruises<br>Snorkeling trips<br>Sunset sails<br>Fishing charters<br><br>Panama City Beach – Just 10 Minutes Away<br>A short drive opens the door to nonstop entertainment:<br>Water parks and family attractions<br>Topgolf<br>Local winery<br>Movie theaters<br>Pier Park shopping, dining, and nightlife<br><br>Destin Attractions<br>A bit farther east, Destin offers even more to explore:<br>Destin Harbor Boardwalk<br>Crab Island<br>World-class fishing charters<br>HarborWalk Village with shops, dining, and live entertainment<br><br>Day Trips to Natural Springs & Rivers<br>Looking to venture beyond the beach? Take a scenic day trip to explore:<br>Crystal-clear natural springs<br>Kayak-friendly rivers and eco-adventures<br>Perfect for swimming, paddleboarding, and experiencing Florida's natural beauty beyond the coast.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Sleeps 18 | Bikes | Sunshine State of Mind | 30A | Pool | Beach Access"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
